    "title": "设置退货单打印模板",
    "keywords": "",
    "description": "",
    "content": "<p><strong>销售单和退货单模板默认是共用同一个模板的，如果需要区分销售单和退货单抬头，要单独设置退货单模板。</strong></p>\n<p><video src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202411/ecc83993571c99bb3545fe30782d8773.mp4\" controls=\"controls\" class=\"my-video\" style=\"max-width:100%\">\n\n\n视频描述\n</video></p>\n<p>1.路径：点击【设置】-【打印设置】-点击销售单默认模板进入到编辑界面-右上角【复制】-输入模板名称-确定。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202308/bb488d22be85d9bc90dad52c877afd09.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>2.把抬头的销售单改成退货单，保存。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202308/6004814d0a7ee54b26c82277966efb22.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>3.到销售退货单点击打印时候选择新增的销售退货单模板。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202308/03f4db27f5e47d3f8efc63108c0b6864.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>4.预览效果如下：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202308/44af5592ce42f6356cd6a8daf2c14011.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n",
